  "description": "The term 'nigger' is a historically and currently offensive racial slur targeting Black individuals. Its use in the meme is a direct and hateful attack, rooted in centuries of racial oppression and dehumanization in the United States and other countries. Understanding the meme requires knowledge of this slur's violent history and its function as a weapon of racial hatred.",
